        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027133",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By using an assembly-line process that employs from approximately 100 to 199 individuals per facility, we are able to manufacture a home in approximately three to six days and can produce, on average, up to approximately 70 home sections, or 60 fully-completed homes depending on product mix, in total per week.",
